      "content": "Your feelings of being trapped by expectations are valid and shared by many people who struggle with pressure to fit societal molds. Connecting with supportive communities or a professional therapist might help you rediscover your own identity outside of these imposed roles. It is important to know you do not have to carry this weight alone, and small steps toward setting boundaries can begin the journey toward real freedom.",
