      "content": "Your desire for freedom and an escape from suffocating demands is a universal human longing for peace, not a moral failure. True freedom often begins by validating these deep feelings rather than pretending to cope with them alone. Please reach out to a crisis line at 988 or a shelter like Childline if these thoughts of leaving become overwhelming, so someone can listen without trying to fix you immediately.",
      "source": "target",
